#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/index.rst:32
msgid "Core Classes"
msgstr "核心类"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/index.rst:2
msgid "Core API Reference"
msgstr "核心 API Reference"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/index.rst:4
msgid "This reference documents the canonical architecture classes that define Recomposable Ecosystem Library for Integrated Coupling (RELIC) composition, state advancement, parameter ownership, graph orchestration, validation, and scientific structure. It does not enumerate every concrete scientific Functor or internal helper."
msgstr "本参考文档说明定义可重组生态系统集成耦合库（Recomposable Ecosystem Library for Integrated Coupling, RELIC）组件组合、状态推进、参数归属、图编排、校验与科学结构的规范架构类，不逐一列举每个具体科学 Functor 或内部辅助函数。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/index.rst:10
msgid "Each class entry identifies the canonical import path, constructor parameters, key methods, lifecycle role, and failure semantics."
msgstr "每个类条目均说明规范导入路径、构造函数参数、核心方法、生命周期角色与失败语义。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/index.rst:14
msgid "Coverage contract"
msgstr "覆盖范围契约"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/index.rst:16
msgid "``core_runtime`` covers every public class exported by ``relic.core`` and the canonical runtime and configuration classes needed to use them. The remaining pages cover the adjacent owners used by that runtime: ``parameters_contracts`` (``4,643`` default runtime parameters across ``138`` YAML files, physical constants, and variable contracts), ``orchestration_validation`` (``GraphIR``, ``PortSpec``, six concrete adapter classes across seven selector keys, validation, compilation, and ``GraphExecutor``), and ``scientific_structure_extensions`` (DEC cochains, ``LinearChainMap``, ``HodgeStarSpec``, ``IPHSStructureSpec``, ``IPHSEquivalenceCertificate``, Python extensions, and C ABI coupling plugins). All ``90`` certified concrete scientific ``Functor`` classes (``BiologicalProcessFunctor``: ``37``, ``TransportMechanismFunctor``: ``27``, ``PhysicalFieldFunctor``: ``14``, ``ScaleCouplingFunctor``: ``12``, backed by ``92`` IPHS YAML certificates) are documented separately in the :doc:`scientific class reference <../science/index>`; private helpers remain outside the public reference."
msgstr "``core_runtime`` 覆盖 ``relic.core`` 导出的全部公开类，以及使用这些类所需的规范运行时与配置类。其余页面覆盖该运行时所依赖的相邻所有者：``parameters_contracts``（跨 ``138`` 个 YAML 文件的 ``4,643`` 个默认运行时参数、物理常数与变量契约）、``orchestration_validation``（``GraphIR``、``PortSpec``、七个选择器键上的六个具体适配器类、校验、编译与 ``GraphExecutor``），以及 ``scientific_structure_extensions``（离散外微分（Discrete Exterior Calculus, DEC）上链、``LinearChainMap``、``HodgeStarSpec``、``IPHSStructureSpec``、``IPHSEquivalenceCertificate``、Python 扩展与 C ABI 耦合插件）。全部 ``90`` 个已认证具体科学 ``Functor`` 类（``BiologicalProcessFunctor``：``37``，``TransportMechanismFunctor``：``27``，``PhysicalFieldFunctor``：``14``，``ScaleCouplingFunctor``：``12``，由 ``92`` 份互连端口哈密顿系统（Interconnected Port-Hamiltonian System, IPHS）YAML 证书支撑）另行记录于 :doc:`科学过程类参考 <../science/index>` ；私有辅助实现不在公开参考文档范围内。"

